OL,5,G1405 The Madame Blanc Mysteries
OL,6,     FThings take a dark turn for Jean
OL,7,     Fwhen she discovers that along with
OL,8,     Fher husband, all of their money
OL,9,     Fhas disappeared, their shop
OL,10,     Fre-mortgaged to the hilt and the
OL,11,     Fassets pawned off.
OL,12,G1505 The Madame Blanc Mysteries
OL,13,     FWhen an elderly local believes
OL,14,     Fthat a treasure holds the key to
OL,15,     Ffinding her missing brother
